  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2jjYpu5.png\"><strong style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></strong></strong></span><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>安装指南</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">​</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">1. 从<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>下载并安装最新版Optifine</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">​</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">2. 定位您的.minecraft文件夹</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">​</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">3. 若不存在，请新建名为\"shaderpacks\"的文件夹</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">​</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">4. 从本页面下载Oceano光影包，将文件放入shaderpacks文件夹</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">​</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">5. 在游戏中进入选项 > 视频设置 > 光影。此处可见所有已安装光影，点击选择所需光影</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">​</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">6. 在菜单右下角点击光影选项。此处可选择预设画质方案，或调整光影的各项参数</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>ShaderLabs社区</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如需联系或参与光影社区，请访问<a href=\"https://discord.gg/N4439Q4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShaderLabs Discord服务器</a>，您也可在此获取未发布的开发版本</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">感谢您下载Oceano光影包，祝您游戏愉快！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JJy2TVx.png\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
